{
  "id": "rideshare-surge",
  "name": "RideShare: Friday Night Surge",
  "description": "You are on call for a ride-hailing platform heading into peak Friday-night demand. Riders, driver GPS pings, and payment webhooks all funnel through a shared backend. Watch for cascading latency, queue backpressure, connection-pool exhaustion, a flaky third-party payment API, and a disk that fills faster than the cleanup cron can drain it.",
